# Markdown (authored content + synced docs) and YAML are not auto-formatted here.
# `*.md` does not match `.mdx`, and project bodies are the one collection that
# accepts it — an .mdx body places DecisionLedger / ConstraintStrip /
# LearningLedger between prose sections, so it carries the same markup
# tag-wrapping hazard as the .astro note below, and the same exact-output tests
# (tests/project-pages.test.js) would catch it. Listing it keeps that intent at
# the ignore layer instead of resting on the format glob happening to omit it.
*.md
*.mdx
*.yml
*.yaml

# .astro templates are NOT auto-formatted: Prettier's markup tag-wrapping leaks
# insignificant whitespace into the compiled HTML, which changes element
# textContent and breaks the site's exact-output tests (e.g.
# tests/project-pages.test.js). Prettier formats the CSS/TS/JS/MJS instead.
*.astro
